# lombok在pom导入dependency不生效问题
### dependency部分代码
```java
        &lt;dependency&gt;
            &lt;groupId&gt;org.projectlombok&lt;/groupId&gt;
            &lt;artifactId&gt;lombok&lt;/artifactId&gt;
            &lt;version&gt;1.18.36&lt;/version&gt;
            &lt;scope&gt;provided&lt;/scope&gt;
        &lt;/dependency&gt;
```

### 解决方式
1.导入dependency的同时引入**plugin**
```java
            &lt;plugin&gt;
                &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.maven.plugins&lt;/groupId&gt;
                &lt;artifactId&gt;maven-compiler-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;
                &lt;configuration&gt;
                    &lt;annotationProcessorPaths&gt;
                        &lt;path&gt;
                            &lt;groupId&gt;org.projectlombok&lt;/groupId&gt;
                            &lt;artifactId&gt;lombok&lt;/artifactId&gt;
                            &lt;version&gt;1.18.36&lt;/version&gt;
                        &lt;/path&gt;
                    &lt;/annotationProcessorPaths&gt;
                &lt;/configuration&gt;
            &lt;/plugin&gt;
```
2.在使用到的类前面加`@Data`。</description><guid isPermaLink="true">https://KEVINN6.github.io/post/lombok-hou-duan-dao-ru-wen-ti.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 21 Apr 2026 05:46:07 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Test1</title><link>https://KEVINN6.github.io/post/Test1.html</link><description>First blog
